//
// @file devices.rho
// @brief Devices as their manifests describe them: reading one over MQTT, and telling one what to do over either transport.
//
// @module mesh.devices
// @project mesh
// @author Aurel Miron
// @date 2026-11-13
//
// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
